# Workspaces produced by the tool. raw_input/ is an immutable archive of
# instrument exports, processed_output/ is regenerated from it, and reports/
# is the combined per-material export rebuilt from processed_output/ on every
# ingest -- none of the three belongs in version control. (data/ covers all
# three when the default workspace is used; the individual names cover a
# workspace pointed elsewhere, e.g. this repo checkout itself.)
data/
raw_input/
processed_output/
reports/
knowledge_base.db

# Real instrument exports used by the regression pins. Drop them in locally;
# they are not redistributed here.
tests/data/*.xlsx
tests/data/*.xls
